# LIBRARY: own
# The cleanup of the inner for-of has the cleanup of the outer one for its handler. Both loops step a list by index alone, so neither cleanup closes anything: a throw in the inner body leaves the function, and the body stands under no handler.
# While it counted as under a handler no turn of the inner typed copy could begin again: the rare arm under a hole came back, met the usual way, and what was read went round boxed.
